{"id": "141284", "name": "חישוב מכפלה פנימית סטנדרטית - מרחב פולינומים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "block([poly:0], for i:0 thru (length(vect)-1) do(poly: poly + x^i*vect[i+1,1]),poly)"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly"], "body": "transpose(rest(coeff_list(x^n+poly,x),-1))"}, {"name": "prod", "params": ["u", "v"], "body": "expand(integrate(u*v,x,-1,1))"}, {"name": "norm", "params": ["v"], "body": "sqrt(prod(v,v))"}, {"name": "sxneg", "params": ["x"], "body": "(numberp(x) and is(x<0)) or (not atom(x) and (op(x)=\"+\" or op(x)=\"-\" or (op(x)=\"*\" and numberp(first(args(x))) and is(first(args(x))<0))))"}, {"name": "sxp", "params": ["x"], "body": "if sxneg(x) then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)"}, {"name": "sxtmul", "params": ["e"], "body": "simplode(map(sxp, args(e)), \" \\\\cdot \")"}, {"name": "sxtsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "sxtnsum", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], if numberp(t) and is(t<0) then concat(\"-\",tex1(-t)) else if sxneg(t) then concat(\"+\",sxp(t)) else concat(\"+\",tex1(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "sxtsq", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(sxp(first(args(e))), \"^2\")"}, {"name": "sxtsub", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(tex1(first(args(e))), \"-\", sxp(second(args(e))))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים הפולינומים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p_1,p_2,p_3\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 3}[x]\\)</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_1(x)={{CT:0}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_2(x)={{CT:1}},\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[p_3(x)={{CT:2}}\\]</p><p>עבור המכפלה הפנימית:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[(p,q) = \\int_{-1}^{1}p(x)\\cdot q(x) dx\\]</p></div><p>חשבו</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\((p_1,p_2)=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\lVert p_3\\rVert=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> בשני הסעיפים מחשבים אינטגרל של מכפלת פולינומים: מכפילים, מוצאים פונקציה קדומה ומציבים את הגבולות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(1\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(-1\\)</span>. הנורמה היא השורש של המכפלה הפנימית של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p_3\\)</span> בעצמו.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — סעיף א׳: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((p_1,p_2)\\)</span></b><br>לפי ההגדרה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((p_1,p_2)=\\int_{-1}^{1}p_1(x)p_2(x)\\,dx\\)</span>. מכפילים את הפולינומים:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ p_1(x)p_2(x)=\\left({{CT:0}}\\right)\\left({{CT:1}}\\right)={{CT:3}} \\]</p>פונקציה קדומה של המכפלה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ F(x)={{CT:4}} \\]</p>ולפי המשפט היסודי של החדו״א:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (p_1,p_2)=F(1)-F(-1)={{CT:5}}={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — סעיף ב׳: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert p_3\\rVert\\)</span></b><br>הנורמה היא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert p_3\\rVert=\\sqrt{(p_3,p_3)}=\\sqrt{\\int_{-1}^{1}p_3(x)^2\\,dx}\\)</span>. מחשבים את הריבוע:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ p_3(x)^2=\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)^2={{CT:7}} \\]</p>פונקציה קדומה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ G(x)={{CT:8}} \\]</p>ולכן<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ (p_3,p_3)=G(1)-G(-1)={{CT:9}}={{CT:10}} \\]</p>הנורמה היא השורש של מספר זה:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\lVert p_3\\rVert=\\sqrt{{{CT:10}}}={{CT:11}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]]", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 10, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varlist: listofvars(ans1);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "varlist", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. תוצאת מכפלה פנימית היא סקלר.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "uvprod", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> הזנת את הערך הנכון עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((p_1,p_2)\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\((p_1,p_2)\\)</span> הינו שגוי.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "nonnegative: is(ans2 >= 0);\nvarlist: listofvars(ans2);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "varlist", "tans": "[]", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> תשובתך אינה נכונה. תוצאת מכפלה פנימית היא סקלר.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "nonnegative", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובתך אינה נכונה. הערך <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert p_3\\rVert\\)</span> אינו יכול להיות שלילי!</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "expand(ans2)", "tans": "expand(wnorm)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — נכון.</b> הזנת את הערך הנכון עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert p_3\\rVert\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הערך שהזנת עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\lVert p_3\\rVert\\)</span> הינו שגוי.</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["k", "n", "sxFpq", "sxFww", "sxpq", "sxw2", "sxww", "u", "uvprod", "v", "w", "wnorm"], "nvariants": 50}